=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 22.7px; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s4\"></span><br></p><p class=\"p3\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s7\">☀️</span><span class=\"s5\">お知らせです！</span></p><p class=\"p2\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 22.7px; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s4\"></span><br></p><p class=\"p3\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s4\">10</span><span class=\"s5\">月</span><span class=\"s4\">10</span><span class=\"s5\">日</span><span class=\"s4\">(</span><span class=\"s5\">土</span><span class=\"s4\">)</span><span class=\"s5\">にある｢シブヤノオト｣さんへの出演が決定しました！</span></p><p class=\"p3\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s5\">日向坂た</span><span class=\"s4\">46</span><span class=\"s5\">は１部２部の両方にでます！</span></p><p class=\"p3\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s5\">ちなみに</span></p><p class=\"p5\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s4\">1</span><span class=\"s5\">部は</span><span class=\"s4\">22</span><span class=\"s5\">時</span><span class=\"s4\">45</span><span class=\"s5\">分〜</span><span class=\"s4\">23</span><span class=\"s5\">時</span><span class=\"s4\">30</span><span class=\"s5\">分</span></p><p class=\"p5\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s4\">2</span><span class=\"s5\">部は</span><span class=\"s4\">24</span><span class=\"s5\">時</span><span class=\"s4\">05</span><span class=\"s5\">分〜</span><span class=\"s4\">25</span><span class=\"s5\">時</span><span class=\"s4\">00</span><span class=\"s5\">分</span